{
  "id": 509558289,
  "iid": 25852,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "UET: Fix SES Rendez-vous extended header",
  "description": "Fix the extended Rendez-vous field layout to match the UET specification.\nThe current layout contains reserved padding and the packet dissection of the fields is incorrect.\n\nThe `read_ri_generation` is not present and is on 1 byte, additionally the `read_pid_on_fep` and `read_resource_index` are on 3 bytes with 12bits each. \n\n* From the spec:\n\n![rendv_header_format](/uploads/4b7ccf29a28f5c314ac498a4f7f05654/rendv_header_format.png){width=900 height=329}\n\n* The wireshark frame shows:\n\n![wrong_frame](/uploads/d79fdf5bc9d1ee11008e366529ce1a07/wrong_frame.png){width=490 height=128}\n\n* With the proposed patch the wireshark frame shows:\n\n![patched_frame](/uploads/b7061d8c7eedea3e56212ef2e79ab2bd/patched_frame.png){width=671 height=132}\n \n* The pcap used to test: [eth_mac_ipv4_udp_tss_pds_ses_req_rendezvous.pcap](/uploads/bbcf22beb33cb1217116619511463a2d/eth_mac_ipv4_udp_tss_pds_ses_req_rendezvous.pcap)",
  "state": "merged",
  "created_at": "2026-07-21T08:16:07.137Z",
